msgctxt "#32212"
msgid "Shows you are rewatching on Trakt match your rewatch progress in Kodi. Episodes watched since the rewatch started are marked watched, and the rest unwatched. Start a rewatch from a show's context menu or on Trakt."
msgstr "Il-programmi li qed terġa' tara fuq Trakt jaqblu f'Kodi mal-progress tar-rewatch tiegħek. L-episodji li rajt minn meta beda r-rewatch jiġu mmarkati bħala li rajthom, u l-bqija bħala li ma rajthomx. Ibda rewatch mill-menu tal-kuntest ta' programm jew fuq Trakt."

msgctxt "#32213"
msgid "Movie sync"
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni tal-filmati"

msgctxt "#32214"
msgid "Episode sync"
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni tal-episodji"

msgctxt "#32215"
msgid "Paused at %s"
msgstr "Imwaqqaf f'%s"

msgctxt "#32216"
msgid "Loading Trakt ratings"
msgstr "Qed jitgħabbew ir-ratings ta' Trakt"

msgctxt "#32217"
msgid "Watching"
msgstr "Qed tara"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "L-add-on Trakt huwa attivat ukoll. Iż-żewġ add-ons jagħmlu scrobble u jissinkronizzaw ma' Trakt, għalhekk kollox isir darbtejn."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Żomm it-tnejn"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Ibda rewatch"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Tibda rewatch fuq Trakt? Il-progress tiegħek jerġa' jibda mill-bidu, u kull episodju jiġi mmarkat f'Kodi bħala li ma rajtux."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Ir-rewatch beda"

msgctxt "#32223"
msgid "Couldn't start rewatch"
msgstr "Ma setax jibda r-rewatch"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Uża t-tema OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Juri l-logo aħmar ta' Trakt, il-qlub u l-kulur tal-enfasi, bħal fuq og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "%i ma setgħux jiġu sinkronizzati"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Il-kont tiegħek ta' Trakt huwa msakkar. Ikkuntattja l-appoġġ ta' Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Intlaħaq il-limitu ta' %i tal-lista ta' x'tara"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Agħżel x'tissinkronizza"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Iftaħ is-setup tas-sinkronizzazzjoni li jidher wara l-konnessjoni ma' Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Issinkronizza meta Kodi jlesti scan jew tindif tal-librerija. Inkella s-sinkronizzazzjoni ssir biss meta tibdieha int, pereżempju mill-menu tal-kuntest."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Javża meta tibda u tispiċċa sinkronizzazzjoni wara scan jew tindif tal-librerija."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Ma juri l-ebda notifika tas-sinkronizzazzjoni waqt li jkun qed jindaqq video."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Iqabbel bit-titlu u s-sena l-oġġetti mingħajr ID ta' IMDb, TMDB jew TVDB, waqt l-iscrobble u s-sinkronizzazzjoni. Qatt ma jintuża biex jimmarka oġġetti bħala li ma rajthomx jew biex iħassar ratings."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Status ta' x'rajt"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Minn Trakt għal Kodi: Kodi jaqbel ma' Trakt, inklużi l-għadd ta' riproduzzjonijiet u d-dati, u kull ma m'għandux riproduzzjonijiet fuq Trakt jiġi mmarkat bħala li ma rajtux. Minn Kodi għal Trakt: l-oġġetti li rajt f'Kodi mingħajr riproduzzjoni fuq Trakt jiżdiedu mal-istorja tiegħu. Iż-żewġ direzzjonijiet: kull naħa tieħu r-riproduzzjonijiet li jonqsuha, u xejn ma jiġi mmarkat bħala li ma rajtux barra minn rewatch ta' Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mitfi"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Minn Trakt għal Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Minn Kodi għal Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "Iż-żewġ direzzjonijiet"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Ratings"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Filmati, programmi u episodji"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Minn Trakt għal Kodi: Kodi jaqbel ma' Trakt, u r-ratings li m'għandux Trakt jitħassru f'Kodi. Minn Kodi għal Trakt: ir-ratings ta' Kodi jiżdiedu ma' Trakt, u jissostitwixxu dawk differenti. Iż-żewġ direzzjonijiet: ir-ratings nieqsa jiġu kkupjati fiż-żewġ naħat, u fejn ikunu differenti jinżamm dak ta' Trakt."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Punti biex tkompli minn Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Kodi jkompli minn fejn Trakt għandu l-oġġett imwaqqaf, pereżempju minn apparat ieħor. Meta dan ikun mitfi, ir-riproduzzjoni f'Kodi xorta tibgħat il-progress tagħha lil Trakt."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Żieda"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Żieda u tneħħija"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Żieda: l-oġġetti ta' Kodi jiżdiedu mal-kollezzjoni ta' Trakt. Żieda u tneħħija: l-oġġetti fil-kollezzjoni li m'għandux Kodi jitneħħew ukoll minnha, inklużi dawk minn apparati jew apps oħra."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Relay dejjem jagħmel scrobble meta jkun konness. Is-sinkronizzazzjoni tkopri dak li baqa' mingħajr scrobble: apparat ieħor, storja eqdem."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Mixgħul"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "L-istatus ta' x'rajt ma jiġix sinkronizzat."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Kodi jaqbel ma' Trakt, inklużi l-għadd ta' riproduzzjonijiet u d-dati. Kull ma m'għandux riproduzzjonijiet fuq Trakt jiġi mmarkat f'Kodi bħala li ma rajtux."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "L-oġġetti li rajt f'Kodi mingħajr riproduzzjoni fuq Trakt jiżdiedu mal-istorja tiegħu. Kodi ma jinbidilx."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Kull naħa tieħu r-riproduzzjonijiet li jonqsuha, u xejn ma jiġi mmarkat bħala li ma rajtux barra minn rewatch ta' Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Ir-ratings ma jiġux sinkronizzati."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Ir-ratings ta' Kodi jaqblu ma' Trakt, u r-ratings li m'għandux Trakt jitħassru f'Kodi."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Ir-ratings ta' Kodi jiżdiedu ma' Trakt, u jissostitwixxu dawk differenti. Kodi ma jinbidilx."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Ir-ratings nieqsa jiġu kkupjati fiż-żewġ naħat. Fejn ikunu differenti, jinżamm ir-rating ta' Trakt."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Kodi jżomm il-punti tiegħu biex tkompli."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Kodi jkompli minn fejn Trakt għandu l-oġġett imwaqqaf, pereżempju minn apparat ieħor."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Is-sinkronizzazzjoni ssir biss meta tibdieha int, pereżempju mill-menu tal-kuntest."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Issinkronizza meta Kodi jlesti scan jew tindif tal-librerija."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Salva u ssinkronizza"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i movies in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Timmarka %i film f'Kodi bħala li ma rajthomx, biex jaqbel ma' Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i movie ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Tħassar ir-ratings ta' %i film f'Kodi biex jaqbel ma' Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32266"
msgid "Unwatch %i episodes in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Timmarka %i episodju f'Kodi bħala li ma rajthomx, biex jaqbel ma' Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32267"
msgid "Clear %i show ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Tħassar ir-ratings ta' %i programm f'Kodi biex jaqbel ma' Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32268"
msgid "Clear %i episode ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Tħassar ir-ratings ta' %i episodju f'Kodi biex jaqbel ma' Trakt?"
